{"4066900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Armored Vehicle Designer", "steam_appid": 4066900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored Vehicle Designer is a sandbox vehicle builder focused on the design and simulation of armored vehicles. The game allows players to modify the shapes and parameters of functional components such as ammo, engines, transmissions, wheels, guns and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance your parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweaking components is not just visual customization but a deep optimization process. Components are often interconnected, you can create a huge ammo casing, but most of the energy will be wasted if your gun barrel is too short! Every design decision comes with its drawbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/6189d32c872b6256ed7ea187a6bf0a45.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/6189d32c872b6256ed7ea187a6bf0a45.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your hull</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your vehicle plate by plate. Armor interacts with projectiles in realistic ways, with penetration based on kinetic energy. Set plate thickness, adjust angles and watch how shots deflect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test it out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, optimize your creations, and fight against other vehicles across diverse scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored Vehicle Designer is a sandbox vehicle builder focused on the design and simulation of armored vehicles. The game allows players to modify the shapes and parameters of functional components such as ammo, engines, transmissions, wheels, guns and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance your parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweaking components is not just visual customization but a deep optimization process. Components are often interconnected, you can create a huge ammo casing, but most of the energy will be wasted if your gun barrel is too short! Every design decision comes with its drawbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/7854873ae0e8af94d2ac20044b2ffb1c.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/6189d32c872b6256ed7ea187a6bf0a45.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/6189d32c872b6256ed7ea187a6bf0a45.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your hull</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your vehicle plate by plate. Armor interacts with projectiles in realistic ways, with penetration based on kinetic energy. Set plate thickness, adjust angles and watch how shots deflect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test it out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, optimize your creations, and fight against other vehicles across diverse scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.poster.avif?t=1769714837\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.webm?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.mp4?t=1769714837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Sandbox vehicle builder where you design armored vehicles. Customize functional parts such as guns, wheels, and engines. Shape your armor and fight other vehicles in various scenarios.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/0f5cf0704ff6f3266b77d9b84ef7ef3970f58436/header.jpg?t=1769714837", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/d6de2f998a58e8195992ef0a7726328290c064ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769714837", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/d6de2f998a58e8195992ef0a7726328290c064ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769714837", "web